Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't chase too far! Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.17,0:00:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to get swept away! Grab a light!{The current is fast! Someone bring a light!}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.35,0:00:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy! He woke up! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.74,0:02:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go. {With this it is good}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.84,0:02:12.36,Default,,2,2,0,,I should mention that, with the way that I found you,\NI thought it best to report what happened to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.19,0:02:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold it against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.99,0:02:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.30,0:02:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say you're remarkably vigorous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And he was {\i1}really{\i0} hungry, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.45,0:02:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He was asleep for two whole days, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.28,0:02:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Harada Kisuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.35,0:02:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,More or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.40,0:02:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my daughter, Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.30,0:02:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you from overseas?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.47,0:02:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, although—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.58,0:02:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How come you can speak Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are your eyes not dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And why is some of your hair white?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.38,0:02:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.44,0:02:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too many questions, Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.63,0:02:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you clear those dishes away?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.49,0:02:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I have to get back to my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.79,0:03:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.98,0:03:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You have guests, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She's pretty suspicious of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure she's not just scared of your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it's me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.31,0:03:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to chase too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stop myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I could feel the animal blood rushing though my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,An animal wouldn't cast its bond with the pack aside like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially not a wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a dream.{"I was dreaming" takes us to the time they were talking about just now, which is wrong}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream of back then.{once we know what "back then" is, I want to revise this line to be more specific}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.94,0:03:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had resisted the animal blood back then,\Nyou wouldn't have been able to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I would just have been dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It is true that your animal blood is of great aid to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you must not allow yourself to drown in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:04:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment you do, you'll no longer be a Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.89,0:04:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I've talked to the master of this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.21,0:04:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He says you can stay until you're healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm healed enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.34,0:04:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If I just keep the bandages tight—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.19,0:04:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just accept the man's kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.29,0:04:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Philip will stay here with you, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.99,0:04:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me? Why not Fallon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.97,0:04:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well you see, it seems that I'm too scary for the little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Take good care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hands off my hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.18,0:04:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.53,0:05:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.22,0:05:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.09,0:05:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.08,0:05:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not supposed to disturb him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.43,0:05:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What about your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.01,0:05:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.92,0:05:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll read a book for you until you get sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Thanks for being my big brother tonight, Yuliy{*Thank you, Yuliy-oniichan}!{honestly, kill me.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.60,0:05:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Your big brother{*Onii-chan}, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your mom get sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.31,0:05:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.66,0:05:49.14,Default,,2,2,0,,Daddy was so sad. He kept crying that even though he was a doctor, he couldn't save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.65,0:05:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dad works pretty late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:05:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.59,0:06:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he's making something so great that he can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.10,0:06:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Something great?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.39,0:06:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He said it would make Mommy happy, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope he finishes soon, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.15,0:06:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and report.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprits broke into the residence of the biologist Abe Yoshiyo and, after murdering him,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,engaged and killed several of the officers who arrived to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hyakko Party, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That group's got a long list of targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.28,0:06:29.32,Default,,2,2,0,,They kill new money and old money families{I don't know is this is completely clear, since "new money" isn't exactly a common term and is not really used in this sort of context, but cps concerns mean I have to do something like this}... public and private\Nresearchers... all while wearing those strange masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.32,0:06:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Their leader, Momose Naotora, calls himself the last true samurai,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.92,0:06:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and demands the revival of the feudal system and equality for—{lmao? feudal system and equality? typical revolutionaries tbh}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"Terrorists."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Terrorists?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what groups like that are called in France.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.93,0:06:49.01,Default,,2,2,0,,The reason they can move in such numbers and not get caught is likely that they have a strong backer.{non-sequitur?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.01,0:06:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that's the source of their funding.{not a question?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.55,0:06:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing that it's a foreign intelligence agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But they call for the expulsion of foreigners.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.41,0:07:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hardly uncommon for someone not to mean what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you think it's V Shipping?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They were the ones who turned the streets into a warzone the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever we do, we mustn't misjudge the font of all this chaos.{too far away from focal point? I get the idea that he means something like "linchpin"}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.78,0:07:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, people like them must not be allowed to walk around our capital like they own the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That is where we come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Make me a mockingbird with lemon instead of lime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry, but we're out of lemon right—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.19,0:07:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't have one in the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected a day to come when I'd have to actually use that countersign.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Alma Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They're our competitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In our {\i1}official{\i0} line of work, that is.{The previous scene talked about gov't backed groups, and "official line of work" could bring up images of "official" as in "government sanctioned/backed." How to fix?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They recently started doing business with the military here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.05,0:07:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been selling and developing weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's much more brazen than I'd expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that Kershner's group is involved?{cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.66,0:08:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd expect them to act more cleverly than this, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.06,0:08:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll continue to gather information.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Big brother{*Yuliy-oniichan} got better!{This is fine imo, now that the concept's been introduced.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,His body sure is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.28,0:08:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He was treated by Doctor Harada, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.02,0:08:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's always been an excellent surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart surgery was his specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.01,0:08:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.02,0:08:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So he took it very hard when his wife died of a heart condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He stopped practicing to spend his time developing a new medical device.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.44,0:08:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,By himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.61,0:08:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He used to have an assistant,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.91,0:08:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but they've been missing since the other day.{gender if possible}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I apologize. I shouldn't make you listen to all this blather.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please enjoy your stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:08:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They sure are getting along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,These are going to need supports.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.65,0:09:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I make some?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.34,0:09:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that would be great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy was the one who decided to grow tomatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.06,0:09:12.95,Default,,2,2,0,,She said that Daddy's always busy with work,\Nso we should make something nutritious to give him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mom sounds kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your mommy kind too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.78,0:09:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone now, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.89,0:09:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She's up in Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet they're friends up in Heaven, just like us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're watching over us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.92,0:09:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, my mother whispers to my heart.{I'm agonizing over this line, trying to connect it to the previous line without butchering it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.97,0:09:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.39,0:09:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.53,0:09:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"I know you can do it," she tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't shut my ears to the words of the dead.{Yuliy seems with-it enough to not say this out loud to a 5 year old. Also, the cut before this implies that he gets lost in thought, I think. It could be out loud, but I think the better choice is italicized.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.93,0:10:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Yuliy{**-san} was hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.41,0:10:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock before you enter a room!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.74,0:10:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm— I'm very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.01,0:10:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not in any mortal danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Would it be possible for me to pay a visit—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your concern,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.15,0:10:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but he'll be back in only a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.42,0:10:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Acting without thought causes trouble for others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.96,0:10:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Restrain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.68,0:10:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.81,0:10:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be letting your mind wander.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.69,0:10:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei, I'd like to have one more match.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.48,0:10:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? That's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.65,0:10:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I'd like to ask of you should I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything for you, {*}Miss Ryouko{*Ojou-sama}.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, if I'm victorious, I'd like you to tell me where Yuliy{**-san} is staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.99,0:11:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Miss Ryouko{*Ojou-sama}, th—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.81,0:11:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I seem to have lost a round\Nbefore we even begin.{I think this gets the joke across, but idk}{I would seem to have been bested once before we even begin.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think the Hyakko Party could be ninjas?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.37,0:11:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, they're masked and wear all black.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And then there's the stuff they write in blood on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.96,0:11:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet those are some kind of ninja spells!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"Divine Retribution."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.19,0:11:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,"Punishment" might be a better translation.{lmao}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.11,0:11:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't make sense.{agreed}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.22,0:11:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The man they killed last night was a biologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.10,0:11:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"Punishment" for a scholar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.03,0:11:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, that does seem strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need to investigate whether there have been any similar cases, including overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.96,0:11:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that vampires are involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.22,0:11:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When someone acts to hide something,\Ntheir actions will always come off as strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't shake the feeling that the Hyakko Party and vampires are connected somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.68,0:11:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There's also that Royal from the other day.{that Royal?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.59,0:12:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They've left some footprints that we can follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.43,0:12:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Kershner will be making his move soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.21,0:12:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You fought a remnant of the Sirius—a mere beast—and now look at you, Agatha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If, despite this taint, you still pride yourself as a member of our race,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,then show me your resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, it's dinnertime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.94,0:12:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this his lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.35,0:12:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bit longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.33,0:12:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Foreign newspapers are part of our selection here, though they're a month behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:12:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, think nothing of it. Baron Naoe is one of our most valued benefactors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.93,0:13:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for showing me the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ciao!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think Yuliy's healed enough to return to duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything else to report?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.09,0:13:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.76,0:13:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.74,0:13:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, I just happened to see the Doctor's papers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.73,0:13:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and he's researching some crazy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.05,0:13:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From what I could gather...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,An artificial heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! I had no idea they were this big!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, tomatoes used to be ornamental plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.67,0:13:45.05,Default,,2,2,0,,People used to think that its red fruit was poisonous, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:45.05,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,You sure are chatty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.42,0:13:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see a plant, you can talk like a friggin' lecturer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.13,0:13:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hate {*}big brother Yuliy{*Yuliy-oniichan}, Philip?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.65,0:14:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's more like...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.38,0:14:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy had a bunch of buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.32,0:14:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,One of those buddies did some bad stuff to my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes him annoy me. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did {*}big brother Yuliy{*Yuliy-oniichan} do something bad, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.18,0:14:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,When it comes down to it, I guess he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.95,0:14:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can be friends with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.41,0:14:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to play it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.10,0:14:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Play it for me, Philip!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm just "Philip," huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's play a song for the princess!{maybe a pavane! oh, spoilers (?)}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.33,0:14:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Saki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:14:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.24,0:14:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I finished it, Saki!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done with work now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Mommy be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.90,0:15:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I'm sure she will be!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.10,0:15:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.93,0:15:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I was always too busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.10,0:15:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, everything I do will be for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It took him long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.10,0:15:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So, um, do you have the money you promised me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.63,0:15:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I absolutely {\i1}despise{\i0} cowardly humans like you.{Are all humans cowardly?}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lacking even a shred of pride or loyalty, fools fit only to be our livestock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please spare—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked into all of the researchers the Hyakko Party has killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.98,0:16:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and it seems that all of them have had some of their results stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There were reports of similar cases overseas as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as you anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.74,0:16:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A biologist who had been researching ways to replace blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.55,0:16:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A college professor who had been trying to develop an iron lung...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.31,0:16:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Artificial organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.67,0:16:31.44,Default,,2,2,0,,Research into growing or creating replacements for\Norgans has been gaining popularity in America and Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.48,0:16:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've found out whose car that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.04,0:16:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The one the vampires were using?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.13,0:16:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes. The license plate number matched that of Doctor Hanada's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.61,0:16:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He reported it as stolen when his assistant disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Mister Willard of V Shipping, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.94,0:17:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.59,0:17:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a reporter for True Crime Stories Monthly. Call me Tada.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize, but we're in a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't take much of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you mind answering just a few questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.42,0:17:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She sure is taking a while to shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.19,0:17:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just make dinner ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.77,0:17:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you cook, Philip?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.19,0:17:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean "{*}big brother Philip{*Philip-oniichan}," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Japan has good fish, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.79,0:17:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just whip up some fish and chips and—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.41,0:17:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy me twenty seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.72,0:18:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.71,0:18:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Royal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.57,0:18:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking your papa for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Though only if my blood accepts him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.53,0:18:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.14,0:18:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.57,0:18:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy! Daddy, don't—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:30.98,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,Saki, get away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.98,0:18:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Philip, stop, he's dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.34,0:18:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.80,0:18:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.85,0:18:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:54.10,Default,,2,2,0,,Who could have expected that a remnant of the Sirius would\Nhound us all the way to this eastern corner of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.51,0:18:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You people smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:19:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll chase you down and kill you until there's not a single one of you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.93,0:19:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm completely lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.51,0:19:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I really would just be a bother if I visit him this late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.52,0:19:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Let go of me, Philip!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.24,0:19:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.19,0:19:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, he's turned out quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.83,0:19:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Saki, run...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you staring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.45,0:19:51.63,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,Saki{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.63,0:19:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can beat me without paying attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Saki{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You mangy Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.35,0:20:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make light of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.28,0:20:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.03,0:20:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.89,0:20:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Beaten by a Sirius...\NSomething lower than an animal...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.28,0:20:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the Ark...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.42,0:20:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,draws you to it now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.94,0:20:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,it's too...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.94,0:20:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,la—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,—te.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.18,0:20:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.39,0:20:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:20:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.26,0:21:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.77,0:21:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.93,0:21:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.05,0:23:30.09,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.55,0:23:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Glowing ash?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.42,0:23:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,With the Ark of Sirius no longer here...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.34,0:23:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Precious family...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.39,0:23:37.14,Default-alt,,2,2,0,,It's possible that he made a blood pact with a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.01,0:23:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogville.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.14,0:23:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.79,0:23:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The land where our destiny will be made.
